<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets call warrants on Thailand Index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call warrants on Thailand Index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. Hong Kong said on Wednesday it was issuing two series of American style call warrants on Citibank Thailand Index.</p>
<p> EXERCISE RATIO   10 warrants for one Index</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 October 31, 1997</p>
<p> ISSUE SIZE	 Tranche A: 5.0 million warrants</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 5.0 million warrants</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     Tranche A: 800 Thai Baht</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 900 Thai Baht</p>
<p> OFFER PRICE	Tranche A: 21.9 percent of spot</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 15.6 percent of spot</p>
<p> PREMIUM	    Tranche A: 12.1 percent</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 17 percent</p>
<p> GEARING	    Tranche A: 4.57X</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 6.43X</p>
<p> LISTING	    London</p>
<p> LISTING DATE     January 6, 1997</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    English</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
